    {
      "subId": "7501001",
      "subQuestName": "Calm the Yumkasaurus down",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750100101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750100101": {
            "id": "750100101",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "\"I have neither goals I must reach, nor have I urgent desires. I am a happy shepherd. I care only for alpacas, for the seasons and things that grow, for the cool breeze and rains...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100102"
            ]
          },
          "750100102": {
            "id": "750100102",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "That's my favorite song. What do you think? Pretty good, huh?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7501002",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the now-calm Yumkasaurus",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750100201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750100201": {
            "id": "750100201",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Ah. It's something furry. Something furry is blocking your path...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100202"
            ]
          },
          "750100202": {
            "id": "750100202",
            "speakerId": 21492,
            "speakerName": "Energetic Alpaca",
            "text": "Mmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100203"
            ]
          },
          "750100203": {
            "id": "750100203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Vigilant Yumkasaurus",
            "text": "Roarrr...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100204"
            ]
          },
          "750100204": {
            "id": "750100204",
            "speakerId": 21492,
            "speakerName": "Energetic Alpaca",
            "text": "Mmmmm—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100205"
            ]
          },
          "750100205": {
            "id": "750100205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? So you're all friends, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100206"
            ]
          },
          "750100206": {
            "id": "750100206",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr! Rawr rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100207"
            ]
          },
          "750100207": {
            "id": "750100207",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Someone who seems in charge of watching the Alpacas comes over and calms the Yumkasaurus...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100208"
            ]
          },
          "750100208": {
            "id": "750100208",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "Hey, hey, calm yourself, Half-Baked. See, that's why you've got your name, making rash judgments like you always do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100209"
            ]
          },
          "750100209": {
            "id": "750100209",
            "speakerId": 21491,
            "speakerName": "\"Half-Baked\"",
            "text": "Rawr...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100210"
            ]
          },
          "750100210": {
            "id": "750100210",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "Don't worry about him, he's just got too strong a sense of duty. Gets all antsy when there are strangers about. But it's also thanks to that dedication that I've got an easy time over here taking care of these Alpacas.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100211"
            ]
          },
          "750100211": {
            "id": "750100211",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "Anyway! What brings you people to my little spot?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100212"
            ]
          },
          "750100212": {
            "id": "750100212",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Just roaming about. You know, on our adventures.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100213"
            ]
          },
          "750100213": {
            "id": "750100213",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "Ah, adventurers, then! That said, I imagine Half-Baked saw you as dangerous folks with the scary, scary auras.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100216"
            ]
          },
          "750100216": {
            "id": "750100216",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. Paimon didn't know that Yumkasaurs could do that. And here we were thinking the Alpacas were about to get attacked! Guess it was all just a misunderstanding, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100217"
            ]
          },
          "750100217": {
            "id": "750100217",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "Aye, and a common one it is, too. I know my fella looks fierce, but he's pretty close to yon' Alpacas. Why, I'd even call them friends!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100218"
            ]
          },
          "750100218": {
            "id": "750100218",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrrooo... Rawr! Rawr! Raaawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100219"
            ]
          },
          "750100219": {
            "id": "750100219",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "Hmm? What's up, little guy? You wanna be friends with them too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100220"
            ]
          },
          "750100220": {
            "id": "750100220",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr! Raaaawrrr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100221"
            ]
          },
          "750100221": {
            "id": "750100221",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, guess so. But yeah, thinking about it, you usually just hang out with the two of us. Some animal friends...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100222"
            ]
          },
          "750100222": {
            "id": "750100222",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "That would do 'im good, yes. Would be quite the adorable scene, too, don't you think — a lil' Tepetlisaur surrounded by Alpaca friends? Me, I could chow down on three bowls of Blazed Meat Stew before I got bored of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100223"
            ]
          },
          "750100223": {
            "id": "750100223",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "Still, that'll depend on whether my Alpacas agree or not. Friendship's not to be forced, and all. Wouldn't you say so, Half-Baked?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100224"
            ]
          },
          "750100224": {
            "id": "750100224",
            "speakerId": 21491,
            "speakerName": "\"Half-Baked\"",
            "text": "Mrrmph.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100226",
              "750100229"
            ]
          },
          "750100226": {
            "id": "750100226",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hey, hey, no need to get all defensive! Let's just give {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} a chance to try this out for himself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100227"
            ]
          },
          "750100227": {
            "id": "750100227",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Kids only grow when they learn how to get by through their own hard work, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100231"
            ]
          },
          "750100231": {
            "id": "750100231",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100232"
            ]
          },
          "750100232": {
            "id": "750100232",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "Well, your Tepetlisaur's got confidence coming out of its ears, or I'm blind. Guess I'll head back and get some rest. Just holler if there's trouble...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100233"
            ]
          },
          "750100233": {
            "id": "750100233",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "Wactana",
            "text": "Wait, you know what? Might as well holler for Half-Baked instead. He's the Alpaca expert here, after all... Just kidding. Alright, little fella, you've got this. Good luck!"
          },
          "750100229": {
            "id": "750100229",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, Paimon knows you're trying to be nice just in case things don't work out... But there's no need to be this pessimistic from the get-go!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750100230"
            ]
          },
          "750100230": {
            "id": "750100230",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Kids need more encouragement to grow up strong and healthy! That's right, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, you can do it! Paimon believes in you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
